<title>NETHERLANDS: Hoek Loos plans Dfl 100 mln share issue.</title>
<headline>Hoek Loos plans Dfl 100 mln share issue.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch chemicals group Hoek Loos said on Friday it planned to raise 100 million guilders through a share issue.  </p>
<p>The company did not announce the price at which the shares would be issued.</p>
<p>It said the money was being raised to fund the purchase, announced last week, of U.S. gas producer and distributor Sunox Inc.</p>
<p>Hoek Loos shares closed at 161.00 guilders on Thursday.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
